WEBVTT

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:09.000
<i>Why... did it turn out this way?!</i>

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:15.190
<i>I know I said I wanted to do
something we'd always remember...</i>

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:18.920
<i>But this is...</i>

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.080
<i>This is...</i>

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.270
Nice reaction, Inoue!

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.130
I got some great pics.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.950
If Inoue was able to get through
without chickening out,

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.260
we should be able to make it even scarier.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:41.940
I... I did the best I could...

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:48.020
This isn't memorable...

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.760
It's traumatizing!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.690
Okay, bring that over here.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:29.500
Careful carrying that. Don't hurt yourself!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:38.300
Welcome to our ultra-realistic haunted house,
brought to you by Amami and her sixth sense!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.510
This will become a culture festival legend!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.070
Just give me normal memories.

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:45.140
Come on, Inoue.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.550
We've got a cute mascot. Meow!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.480
W-Well, I guess this is all right...

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:54.980
Or so it looks, until...

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:55.900
Boo!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.260
Yay!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:02.490
I-Inoue...

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.620
Amami, I'd like your advice about the interior.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.330
Oh, sure!

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:10.080
Um...

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.840
Excuse me for a moment.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:19.270
<i>She seems happy...</i>

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.090
Well...

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.680
Ready to get back to work?

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.980
If we don't finish today,
we'll end up spending the night here.

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.480
That sounds cool.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.550
With Amami around,

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:32.350
the school at night should give me
all kinds of blog material.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.490
Wow, she's going all-out to
make sure everything is done on time.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.410
She <i>really</i> doesn't want to spend the night here.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.200
I'm exhausted...

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.920
You worked really hard, Inoue!

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.920
Huh? What is it, Amami?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.090
Really? That's great to know.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.020
Thank you!

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:09.940
Talking to nobody again...

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.020
Who are you speaking to now?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:17.280
This kind soul was telling me about
a Japanese sweets shop nearby.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.260
He seems to love sweets.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.610
But...

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:27.640
He has a big hole where his stomach should be,

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.620
so even if I leave an offering, he can't eat it...

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.210
Was he the one who just screamed?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.550
Dad?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:44.640
Amami's...

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:46.300
...dad?

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:47.890
Yes...

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.680
He's got white hair?!

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:52.770
H-He's been through a lot...

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.440
What brings you here?

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:58.330
I just finished work, so I came to pick up...

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.680
Oh, I should introduce myself.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.190
I'm Amami Asahi.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.370
I'm an archaeology professor at the university.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.390
Hibiki... My daughter tells me
you're all good friends to her.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:13.080
Um, may I ask why you were screaming?

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.540
Oh, er...

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.090
Sorry, I got a message.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:22.920
Sweet! A ghost picture I can put on my blog!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.260
A-Again?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.690
Yeah, see?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.140
I guess your actions
answer the question for you?

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:33.850
And her response is the same?

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.060
I'm embarrassed to admit it,

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:41.690
but I can't handle that sort of thing...

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.080
No way!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.200
Even though you're living with Amami?

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.780
It's true...

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.200
There's something white on your shoulder.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.580
There's a black shadow at your feet!

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.590
Of course there is.

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:07.290
I can't believe a jumpy guy like this
has a daughter with a sixth sense.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:13.720
Um, I'm told my mother
also had the same ability...

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:18.850
Wait, so you inherited your
sixth sense from your mom?

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.360
I suppose so.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:32.620
This "sixth sense" or whatever you call it is ridiculous!

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.650
I-Inoue?

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.140
I-I'm not apologizing!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:42.710
Huh?

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:50.600
Come to think of it, I first met
my wife at this intersection.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:06:58.940
A pigeon?

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:00.520
In a place like that—

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:01.980
I'm on my way!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.530
Wait!

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.280
The pigeon wants to say something!

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:11.400
Coo-coo-coo-cooo, coo-cooooo!
If you jump into the street now, you'll get hit by a car!

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:16.240
The first words she spoke to me were in pigeon.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.910
That's a new one.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.920
Who are you?

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:27.170
This little guy called out to me.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:33.810
He told me a reckless young man
was trying to save his lifeless corpse.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.060
Um...

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:41.400
Yes?

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:42.810
I'm...

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.290
I'm Amami Asahi!

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:49.900
And, u-um...

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:53.410
Er, well...

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:55.020
You are...?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:08:00.170
You can call me Yuuhi.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.460
Yuuhi...

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:07.910
But Asahi, you mustn't be so reckless.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:10.130
If something were to happen to you...

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.800
I'm so ashamed.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:15.360
...all the people behind you would be devastated.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.190
Pardon?

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:33.360
And that was where our relationship started.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:36.150
That's a hell of a way to start a relationship.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:39.640
A wimp like him married a woman with a sixth sense, huh?

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:40.870
Wait, is that...

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:45.330
It didn't even take a week.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:47.670
<i>That's what turned his hair white?!</i>

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:53.510
So what pick-up lines did you use?

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.640
Oh, come on...

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.680
Well, if you must know...

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.140
You don't seem reluctant to share at all.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:14.570
The sunset is beautiful,

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.580
but it's also sad, don't you think?

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.250
What?

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.840
Because when the sun sets...

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:24.660
It means we must part.

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:27.040
Wow, what a poet!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.510
And then? What did she say?!

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:35.280
This moment when evil spirits run rampant,

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:38.800
as light sinks into the darkness...

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:45.850
This is when my true ability comes to life, as well!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.210
When dusk falls?!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.820
Was your wife's sixth sense
even stronger than Amami's?

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.070
Yes.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:59.280
Sometimes she even made predictions.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:05.160
You foul, lecherous cat!

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.500
How dare you do that to an innocent girl?!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.670
I wonder what she saw then.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.970
Check out this choice selection of babes!

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.680
Let's see those pant—

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:24.230
Huh?!

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.700
Um, did you just...

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.110
No, it was nothing important.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.150
Anyway, things seem rather lively tonight.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:40.820
Indeed! I'm walking home
with my friends and my dad.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:45.910
Oh, I'm sorry I don't have an offering today.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.990
You're a kid. Don't worry about that.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.870
You only get so much allowance, right?

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.170
Indeed.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:11:00.680
Ah, I get it now.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:07.310
You know the old saying about how girls tend to fall for people who resemble their fathers?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.150
Wh-Wh-What are you implying?!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:16.150
And what does that reaction mean?!

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:20.910
I had a great time this evening.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:25.160
I haven't spoken to any of
Hibiki's friends in a long time.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:27.920
Well then, you're in luck.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:30.740
Our culture festival is tomorrow.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.650
The classes will be running food stalls.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.920
You should come visit!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.270
That's right, it's tomorrow.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:39.510
You're sure it's all right if I drop by?

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:44.930
Amami helped out every step of the way, so I think that it'll turn out great.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.770
You did, Hibiki?

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:49.620
Yes.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.230
I see. Then I'll be happy to go.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.110
We'll be waiting!

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.940
Yep. Ready to go home, Hibiki?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:02.040
Yes. See you all tomorrow.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:08.760
Can we buy Mom some Japanese sweets
for an offering on the way?

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.570
I found out about a really good place...

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:13.430
Hey, by the way...

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:17.880
Do you think Amami told her dad

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.740
that our class is doing a haunted house?

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:36.960
Talk about a fierce pace.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.720
We really are gonna be a culture festival legend.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.280
Right?

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:47.030
No one needs a legend like this.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.630
Yeah, maybe.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:54.040
Amami only asked the ghosts
to help oversee things, but...

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:02.970
I didn't expect them to be so enthusiastic
that they'd join the cast on the day.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:08.260
I can't take this! Why do I have to
dress up like a ghost too, anyway?

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:12.420
I had you work out here because
you're too scared to work inside.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:14.270
Don't complain.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:18.400
Here, go hand out all of these flyers.

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:20.580
Oh, fine...

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.280
<i>All</i> of them.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:34.080
All you people think it's
hilarious to see me scared!

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:43.670
It is surprisingly difficult
to intentionally scare someone.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.980
Something just ran by under my feet!

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.360
That dead old guy smiled at me!

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.350
Someone's whispering in my ear!

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:55.760
The others have already taken to this work.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.940
I'm too ashamed to face Lady Amami now...

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.310
Our costumes match.

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:09.500
Let's both do our best.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:17.750
All right...

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.510
A warrior ghost!

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:30.140
Roll-call samurai's overdoing it!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.310
Can someone go pick up lunch?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.900
Okay, I'll take care of it.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.060
I'll help you.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:42.570
Maybe we'll run into my dad on the way.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.740
So he is coming, then?

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:46.960
Yes.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:53.240
I'll be really happy if I can show him
the project we all worked so hard on together.

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:57.960
Hey, Amami, you did tell him
that it's a haunted house, right?

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:03.110
Are you trying to kill him?!

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.630
A culture festival...

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:10.310
It sure is packed.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.120
Here.

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:12.400
Thank y—

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.140
Huh?

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:23.940
What?

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:26.770
That hair, and those clothes...

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.280
Is that you, Hibiki?

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.030
What?

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:36.040
You're totally different from yesterday!

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.010
I finally got them all handed out.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:57.310
It's been like this all the time lately...

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.360
You're Inoue, right?

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:04.390
The other kids told me
a little about you yesterday.

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:05.150
Huh?

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:06.920
Pardon me.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:14.780
You're still safe.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.420
From what?

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:23.580
Sorry, I just felt bad that this is
all putting so much strain on you.

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:29.690
I-It's no one's fault...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:33.470
I just hate being made fun of.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.510
I see...

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:39.220
<i>Of course you wouldn't say
it in front of her father,</i>

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.970
<i>but I know you never place the blame
on Hibiki or the ghosts she sees.</i>

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.860
<i>You're a nice girl.</i>

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.980
What are you smiling about?

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:51.140
Oh, it's nothing. Shall we get going?

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:54.550
Sure. I'm finally done with
handing out these flyers.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.790
Are you gonna be okay at
the haunted house, though?

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:01.790
O-O-O-Of course!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.040
Uh... You don't have to force yourself...

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:08.600
It's been such a long time, you know.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:14.220
Since Hibiki was last part of something at school with her friends, that is.

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:19.810
So I want to see it, no matter what.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.750
She tried really hard!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.310
She worked as one with the whole class

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.360
and took everything super seriously.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.810
She worked her hardest,

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.740
and she was really happy.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.990
So please go see it!

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.240
See what we and Amami made together!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.960
I'm sorry, Asahi.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.320
What are you apologizing for?

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:55.700
For leaving you behind because
of my own selfishness...

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.810
I don't care how little time we have.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:06.630
Just having spent it with you
makes me the happiest man on Earth.

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:13.110
But our baby...

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:15.650
It's okay.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.950
I've seen what will happen.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:26.460
She'll have to endure some pain and sadness,

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:30.950
but she'll find many kind people
who will take her by the hand.

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.800
Really?

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:38.260
Yes!

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:41.310
Well, let's head home.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.660
We'll practice making fried eggs tonight.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.600
Just go easy on me.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:52.290
U-Um...

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.910
What is it?

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:57.570
Thank you.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.200
Really, thank you.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.950
Oh, um... uh...

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:07.560
L-Let's just get going.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:10.650
Oh, I'll take that. You can get the door.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:13.090
No, I can handle it.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:25.480
Wh-Why did the door open by itself?

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:28.350
Usually they reserve that service for Amami...

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.400
Wait, are they...

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.730
mistaking me for her?!

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:39.490
I'm with her actual dad, too.
That just makes it more misleading...

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.910
N-No, it couldn't...

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.450
You've done well.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:50.170
Lunchtime!

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.250
Hey. What's up?

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.270
You dropped your box.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:03.030
No!

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.980
Stop!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:07.480
Yoo-hoo, Amami!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.660
White with pink stripes!

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:35.040
I bought lunch!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.560
Oh, thanks.

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.800
I was waiting for this!

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:42.800
These are for all of you.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.060
Yay.

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:45.420
Yippee!

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:47.140
Oh, it's Noritama!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.520
Dad, you're here!

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:58.280
Is that... What? Inoue?!

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:00.980
What happened to your hair?!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.860
Don't tell me you got so terrified, you...

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.030
No, it's...

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.900
And that's why.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:16.630
I see... Thank goodness.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.380
